{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"421277b4-c47b-4fb2-b262-81bab3551920","type":"text","text":"## Canvas Legend\n\n**Green** = business workflow stage\n**Yellow** = external source / enrichment\n**Blue** = CRM / AI action\n**Purple** = output / management visibility\n**Dashed side flow** = existing/manual lead path that must continue to work","x":0,"y":160,"width":1100,"height":240},
		{"id":"c4fce571-9255-45b9-879c-485d72a944d8","type":"text","text":"## 6. AUTOMATED FOLLOW-UP\n\nCRM controls the follow-up sequence after outreach.\n\nExamples:\n• Follow-up #1 after defined interval\n• Follow-up #2 / final touch\n• Stop sequence when a response is received\n• Stop / pause for negative response\n\n**Human override:** salesperson can pause, edit, or take ownership.","x":5700,"y":500,"width":900,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"92366a9d-c13f-498a-b668-329905dc0949","type":"text","text":"### External Signal Source\n**LinkedIn / job portals / other signal sources**\n\nFor the initial design, LinkedIn signal discovery may remain manual.\nDo not depend on a LinkedIn API for the signal unless separately validated.","x":0,"y":950,"width":1100,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"face8bde-9864-40f1-bfa3-c884eaa396f0","type":"text","text":"### Contact Enrichment\n**Apollo API**\n\nPrimary enrichment layer for contact discovery.\nRetrieve decision-maker/contact details and supporting context where available.","x":2200,"y":950,"width":1100,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8f1f318b-747b-49c6-85f5-1ed1a1571ac6","type":"text","text":"### Existing / Legacy Enrichment\n**Tiv(e)ly / current scraper flow**\n\nMay continue to support company/profile research or existing lead enrichment.\nIt is not the primary contact-procuring layer.","x":4500,"y":950,"width":950,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"de275c69-7d6b-402e-80be-bd341e87578a","type":"text","text":"## Existing Lead / Event-Based Path — KEEP THIS\n\nNot every lead starts with a signal search.\n\nExamples:\n• Event / conference contact\n• Referral\n• Inbound enquiry\n• Manually added lead\n• Business card / known prospect\n\nThese leads should enter the same **Research → Contact/Enrichment → AI Qualification → Outreach → Follow-up → Meeting** pipeline.","x":0,"y":1320,"width":1700,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"622b6221-71e1-45f1-a45f-9c90fc3f55c4","type":"text","text":"## Human-in-the-Loop\n\nAutomation should reduce repetitive work, not remove ownership.\n\nHuman decisions remain for:\n• Signal validation when uncertain\n• ICP overrides\n• Email approval / editing where required\n• Follow-up control\n• Meeting participation\n• Opportunity decisions","x":2000,"y":1320,"width":1700,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b4e219c2-ad9f-4d25-997f-ab448a60b29e","type":"text","text":"## MVP vs Target State\n\n**MVP / Immediate:**\n• Abhi practices signal → research → contact discovery manually for ~1 week\n• Validate Apollo API + pricing / credit model\n• Validate CRM workflow locally\n\n**Target:**\n• CRM-driven signal ingestion\n• Apollo enrichment via API\n• AI ICP qualification\n• Automated personalised outreach + follow-up\n• Daily management dashboard","x":4000,"y":1320,"width":1800,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"291c65d2-523c-48a1-b304-054e594b000a","type":"text","text":"## Success Metrics\n\nMeasure the full funnel, not just number of leads:\n**Signals → Qualified Leads → Emails Sent → Responses → Positive Responses → Meetings → Opportunities**\n\nExample business expectation discussed:\nHigh-volume outreach can be successful even when only a small percentage converts, provided the process is targeted and measurable.","x":6100,"y":1320,"width":2000,"height":250,"color":"7"},
		{"id":"4224f7f0-52e9-46cc-a8c6-916c0132ff1f","type":"text","text":"# KRUISE CRM — Automated Sales Prospecting & Lead Qualification\n\n**Goal:** move from “add a lead” to a signal-driven workflow: **Signal → Research → Contact → AI Qualification → Outreach → Follow-up → Meeting → Reporting**\n\nDesign principle: a lead does **not** have to come from an event. A lead can originate from any credible business signal.","x":0,"y":-160,"width":1100,"height":180},
		{"id":"27020336-de93-444d-8bea-1cf5a12a3c56","type":"text","text":"## 1. SIGNAL DETECTION\n\n**Input:** credible indication that a company may need our services.\n\nExamples:\n• Head / Director / Lead roles in Data & AI\n• Data platform / analytics hiring\n• Technology or transformation initiatives\n• Other business signals discovered by the sales team\n\n**Key rule:** signal first, lead second.","x":-40,"y":450,"width":900,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"365f44bf-e561-4910-8c11-8237a3e1b770","type":"text","text":"## 3. CONTACT DISCOVERY\n\n**Primary candidate: Apollo**\n\nUse API-based enrichment to find relevant decision-makers for the signal:\n• Name / role\n• Company\n• Work email\n• Phone / mobile where available\n    • Relevant Data & AI leadership / buying roles\n\n**Important:** contact discovery is different from company qualification.","x":2220,"y":-60,"width":900,"height":340,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"6efbe69e-9a2f-4922-bb08-0584e79fa7bc","type":"text","text":"### Alternative\n**Hunter**\n\nSecondary option for email discovery / verification.\nEvaluate alongside Apollo rather than making it the primary flow.","x":3500,"y":1000,"width":800,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ed6ec2f7-7864-4b65-b0dd-29fd8a018bbf","type":"text","text":"## 2. COMPANY RESEARCH\n\nBuild context before contacting anyone:\n• Company identity\n• Industry / sector\n• Company size / scale\n• Relevant leadership\n• Technology direction\n• Current business need implied by the signal\n\n**Output:** researched company record + signal context.","x":1160,"y":450,"width":900,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fa2b0b50-69c7-4a82-b692-b26b2f50ee80","type":"text","text":"## 4. AI QUALIFICATION — ICP FIT\n\nAI evaluates the researched company + contact against the defined Ideal Customer Profile.\n\nChecks:\n• Target sector?\n• Target company profile / size?\n• Relevant Data & AI need?\n• Technology fit?\n• Can Kruise support the requirement?\n• Exclusions / “do not pursue” rules?\n\n**Output:** Qualified / Review / Disqualify + reasons.","x":3600,"y":-140,"width":900,"height":340,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"edce9483-697d-4487-9c7d-e5312856f7d1","type":"text","text":"## 5. OUTREACH\n\nGenerate and send personalised communication from the CRM.\n\nWorkflow:\nSignal context → Company context → Contact context → Personalised email template\n\nTrack:\n• Email sent\n• Delivery / engagement where available\n• Response\n• Positive / negative outcome\n\n**Goal:** high-volume, relevant outreach — not generic spam.","x":4900,"y":-140,"width":900,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a40b2958-ec61-4036-aea5-439cf1abcef4","type":"text","text":"## 7. MEETING / HANDOFF\n\nWhen interest is detected:\n1. Schedule meeting\n2. Attach lead + company + signal context\n3. Show previous outreach / responses\n4. Prepare relevant internal owner(s)\n\nExample: business lead + Data subject-matter expert join the call.","x":7050,"y":115,"width":900,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"8c7c5e52-caf4-4a76-8477-0af90fed3fe1","type":"text","text":"## CRM RECORD CREATED / UPDATED\n\n**Lead**\n• Source / signal\n• Company\n• Contact\n• Research context\n• ICP qualification\n• Outreach status\n• Follow-up state\n• Meeting / opportunity status\n• Activity history\n\n**Everything remains visible from the CRM — no separate Apollo login required for normal users.**","x":5800,"y":950,"width":1250,"height":365,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bfc7feaa-6703-4fa3-ac58-1525407c77f5","type":"text","text":"## 8. DAILY MANAGEMENT REPORT\n\nManagement view answers:\n• How many signals found?\n• How many companies researched?\n• How many contacts discovered?\n• How many qualified?\n• How many emails sent?\n• How many responded?\n• How many follow-ups due?\n• How many meetings scheduled?\n    • Which leads need attention?\n\n**Outcome:** start the day with an actionable sales pipeline.","x":8180,"y":365,"width":900,"height":395,"color":"7"},
		{"id":"f21adc83-9896-438b-b430-7488b8bc8e09","type":"text","text":"## Suggested Lead Lifecycle\n\n**Signal Found** → **Researching** → **Contact Found** → **AI Review** → **Qualified** → **Outreach Sent** → **Follow-up** → **Engaged** → **Meeting Scheduled** → **Opportunity**\n\nTerminal / exception states:\n**Disqualified / No Response / Do Not Contact**","x":7400,"y":983,"width":1000,"height":300,"color":"2"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"caf3dd97-9669-458f-bb0e-c50bf2a7a8c5","endArrow":"arrow","fromNode":"27020336-de93-444d-8bea-1cf5a12a3c56","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ed6ec2f7-7864-4b65-b0dd-29fd8a018bbf","toSide":"left","label":"signal context"},
